  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_0352.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Pakopes, en la avenida del Mont&iacute;, 20 de Tales, ha acogido este s&aacute;bado un concierto en sesi&oacute;n doble de la Orkesta Pelillo. Si por la tarde han sido muchas las personas que se han congregado para oir las&nbsp;originales versiones de punk-rock del grupo ondense, por la noche, hasta bien entrada la madrugada, la asistencia ha sido m&aacute;s multitudinaria.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0122.jpg\" alt=\"img_0122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0124.jpg\" alt=\"img_0124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0125.jpg\" alt=\"img_0125\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0126.jpg\" alt=\"img_0126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0127.jpg\" alt=\"img_0127\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0128.jpg\" alt=\"img_0128\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0129.jpg\" alt=\"img_0129\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0130.jpg\" alt=\"img_0130\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertpelillopakopes/img_0131.jpg\" alt=\"img_013